# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. FLUTTER RUN & BUILD COMMANDS
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local Development (Android Emulator):
#   flutter run -d emulator-5554 --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8000/api
#
# Local Development (Physical Android Device):
#   flutter run -d <DEVICE_ID> --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.100:8000/api
#
# Production Release APK:
#   flutter build apk --release --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=https://api.mosje-inspection.gov.in/api
#
# Production App Bundle (Play Store / MDM):
#   flutter build appbundle --release --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=https://api.mosje-inspection.gov.in/api
